  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">Hi all，</span><br style=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">【</span><span class=\"\">福马迎春送财运</span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">】活动将于2.11日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源及礼物配置。</span><br style=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;</span><br style=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">资源奖励</span></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 34.3496%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 10.8134%;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 21.7584%;\" /> <col style=\"width: 8.29521%;\" /><col style=\"width: 5.48077%;\" /><col style=\"width: 53.6226%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>类型</td><td>名称</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>勋章</td><td>财神到我家</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>用户，唯一型。<span class=\"font2\">2026</span><span class=\"font1\">年春节福马迎春送财运活动获得～</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>马上发财麦序框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>马上发财头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>发言波纹</td><td>马上发财发言波纹</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>上麦动效</td><td>马上发财上麦动效</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>福气满满头像框</td><td>9463</td><td><br /></td><td>改名字</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>挂件</td><td>马上发财挂件</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">使用资源id：</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 15.0307%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 100.0%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>资源id</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>喜神直播间画面id：5913</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>寿神直播间画面id：5914</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>禄神直播间画面id：5915</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>福神直播间画面id：5916</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>财神直播间画面id：5917</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p>",
